  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved access to financial services in Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment aims to further actualize the existing local operations of a Dutch financial technology (fintech) company in Peru by means of additional staff and equipment. This fintech company enables an IT platform for financing receivables of micro companies and SMEs in Peru together with local banks and large companies. The development impact of this investment is based on supporting banks/large companies in offering credits to micro companies and SMEs, which have difficulty in attracting ample funding for their operations and further growth. This initiative should considerably alleviate the lack of funding and will thereby promote further economic growth in Peru. With a loan of &#x20ac;2.000.000 of DGGF CTC will be able to considerably alleviate thelack of funding and will thereby promote further economic growth in Peru.</narrative>
  </description>
